1
00:00:03,378 --> 00:00:05,458
(Penny:)Oh, my God, I love this chicken.

2
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:10,422
(Sheldon:)Oh, you know what they say,
"The best things in life are free."

3
00:00:10,635 --> 00:00:13,095
(Penny:)You're right. I eat your food a lot.
How about this?

4
00:00:13,304 --> 00:00:15,264
(Penny:)You can raid my fridge
any time you want.

5
00:00:15,473 --> 00:00:16,803
(Sheldon:)Oh, that's very kind of you.

6
00:00:17,017 --> 00:00:20,057
(Sheldon:)Next time I have a hankering
to wash down a D-cell battery...

7
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:23,150
(Sheldon:)...with a jar of old pickle juice,
I'll come a-knocking.

8
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:27,152
(Howard:)Hey, Raj, you didn't send your RSVP in.

9
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,820
(Howard:)I'm supposed to ask you
if you're bringing someone.

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,110
(Raj:)I'll let you know.

11
00:00:31,322 --> 00:00:33,992
Could you make it soon?
There's a battle over seating.

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,200
ln one corner, Bernadette's mom.
ln the other three, mine.

13
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:41,999
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I hate wedding receptions.
l wish the bride and groom...

14
00:00:42,208 --> 00:00:43,998
(Sheldon:)...would take a cue from Bilbo Baggins.

15
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,130
(Sheldon:)Slip on the ring, disappear,
and everyone goes home.

16
00:00:47,672 --> 00:00:49,962
Oh, you liked Professor Geyser's wedding.

17
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,470
They had a make-your-own-sundae bar.

18
00:00:52,677 --> 00:00:54,847
(Sheldon:)Oh, that was a night to remember.

19
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:58,975
Do you know, on one trip,
l just had a bowl of nuts.

20
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:02,059
(Howard:)Anyway, you gotta let me know
if you have a plus-one.

